   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "To improve your salah, change one thing at a time. Pray earlier in the time, slow each position, learn the meaning of what you recite, and pray as the Prophet taught. Add the regular sunnah prayers and a short remembrance afterwards. Allah says the believers are those who are humble in their prayer."
