   "id": "worship_better.howto.002",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "If you are starting from nothing, start with one prayer and add the next every week or two. Pray it on time, even if short, and learn the words for it first. Build up to five without guilt about the past. Every prayer you add is a win, and Allah accepts what you do, not what you could not yet do."
   },
   "ageBand": ["all"],
