   "id": "worship_better.howto.003",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "If you keep delaying the prayer, make it automatic. Set the prayer times in the app, put a small action right before each one (water, wudu, a quick tidy), and pray as soon as the call comes. Tell someone near you so you pray together. The Prophet said the most beloved deed to Allah is prayer at its proper time."
   },
